{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1236","id":3987014722,"node_id":"PR_kwDOO5D6p87tpQRC","html_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pull/1236","diff_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pull/1236.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pull/1236.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/issues/1236","number":1236,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"[AO-HVY-20] Run visual-blocked runtime smoke","user":{"login":"Samsen879","id":172257175,"node_id":"U_kgDOCkRvlw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/172257175?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879","html_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## Summary\n- Adds a repeatable local visual-blocked runtime smoke harness for #1205.\n- Selects deterministic visual-required samples across missing visual, rights-unconfirmed, candidate-only, and fallback-needed cases.\n- Writes JSON and Markdown readbacks with sample IDs, blocked/fallback outcomes, local logging, telemetry queue evidence, and no-claim boundaries.\n\nCloses #1205\n\n## Sample IDs and Outcomes\n- `missing_visual`: `qrow_9709_m16_qp_12_q07` - blocked fallback, no protected source display, no complete display marking.\n- `rights_unconfirmed`: `qrow_9709_m16_qp_12_q09` - blocked fallback, rights blockers preserved, no protected source display.\n- `candidate_only`: `qrow_9709_m16_qp_12_q10` - blocked fallback, candidate-only blockers preserved, no accepted display claim.\n- `fallback_needed`: `qrow_9709_m25_qp_12_q02` - blocked fallback, fallback route remains conservative, no protected display.\n\n## Telemetry and Logging Evidence\n- Smoke readback: `artifacts/method-map/v1-9709/visual-blocked-runtime-smoke-readback.md` and `.v1.json`.\n- Local blocked logging records `visual_blocked_fallback_presented` with zero answer events for all 4 samples.\n- Attempt telemetry emits 4 `full_beta_3530_attempt_visual_blocked` events with `blocked_visual_display_local_only`, `attempt_recorded=false`, and `valid_attempt_status=not_valid_attempt`.\n- Visual usage queue validation passes with 4 safe visual-blocked hits, 0 rejected telemetry events, 4 real-usage priority rows, and no private learner data or protected source visual payload.\n\n## Boundaries\n- No acceptance, rights approval, SourceVisualReceipt approval, SourceFigureAsset student-display acceptance, student-display-final, launch-readiness, official scoring, Phase B2 readiness, remote Supabase mutation, storage upload, HTTP write probe, or external VLM claim is made.\n\n## Verification\n- `npm test -- --runInBand --runTestsByPath scripts/smoke/__tests__/full-beta-visual-blocked-runtime-smoke.test.js --verbose`\n- `node scripts/smoke/full-beta-visual-blocked-runtime-smoke.mjs`\n- `npm test -- --runInBand --runTestsByPath scripts/smoke/__tests__/full-beta-visual-blocked-runtime-smoke.test.js src/pages/paper-workspace/__tests__/full-beta-visual-blocked-runtime.test.js src/pages/paper-workspace/__tests__/full-beta-text-first-attempt-flow.test.js scripts/learning/__tests__/full-beta-3530-attempt-event-contract.test.js scripts/method-map/__tests__/visual-usage-figureasset-priority-queue.test.js --verbose`\n- `npm run lint:changed`\n- `npx eslint scripts/smoke/full-beta-visual-blocked-runtime-smoke.mjs scripts/smoke/__tests__/full-beta-visual-blocked-runtime-smoke.test.js`\n- `git diff --check`\n- `git diff --cached --check`\n- `npm run workflow:codex-preflight -- --json`\n","created_at":"2026-07-03T15:28:20Z","updated_at":"2026-07-03T15:31:54Z","closed_at":"2026-07-03T15:31:54Z","merged_at":"2026-07-03T15:31:54Z","merge_commit_sha":"db2d96cc35df3a90785285edd14c26e495d3c0b5","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1236/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1236/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/issues/1236/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/statuses/cd7c0219507905a881b385637777fded83188f7c","head":{"label":"Samsen879:feat/issue-1205","ref":"feat/issue-1205","sha":"cd7c0219507905a881b385637777fded83188f7c","user":{"login":"Samsen879","id":172257175,"node_id":"U_kgDOCkRvlw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/172257175?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879","html_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/events{/privacy}","rece